        "fields": {
          "notes": "Scholarly doctoral thesis awarded by the University of Groningen on 25 September 1997 and reported as 405 pages. It reconstructs the elementary Nippur sequence from lexical lists and exercise-tablet relations. The separate 2023 chapter Reconstructing the Elementary Nippur Curriculum supplies a later control on curriculum as a modern reconstructive category. Scribal Worlds 2026 supplies further classification and context. Current coverage is bibliographic, with source-reported authorship awaiting review."
